    "Aperture and Shutter keep the value you set and suggest the other. ISO suggests the sensitivity for the aperture and shutter speed you set." : {
      "comment" : "Help topic about exposure modes",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aperture and Shutter keep the value you set and suggest the other. ISO suggests the sensitivity for the aperture and shutter speed you set."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apertura y Velocidad mantienen el valor que fijas y sugieren el otro. ISO sugiere la sensibilidad para la apertura y la velocidad que fijas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
