    "Average measures the whole scene. Spot measures only the area around the point you tap on the screen. Switch between them with the viewfinder button." : {
      "comment" : "Help topic about metering modes",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Average measures the whole scene. Spot measures only the area around the point you tap on the screen. Switch between them with the viewfinder button."
