    "If Midgray reads differently from your camera or a hand-held meter, adjust it in Settings until they match." : {
      "comment" : "Help topic about calibration",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If Midgray reads differently from your camera or a hand-held meter, adjust it in Settings until they match."
